So this is the part where
the slides were sort

00:25:35.850 --> 00:25:36.840
of like messed up.

00:25:36.840 --> 00:25:39.990
So I wanted to just suggest, let's see.

00:25:39.990 --> 00:25:43.590
Okay, so the point here
is that the lot is not

00:25:43.590 --> 00:25:47.400
very commonly used based
on my data collection

00:25:47.400 --> 00:25:49.380
among historical cases

00:25:49.380 --> 00:25:51.553
of historical communities practicing form

00:25:51.553 --> 00:25:53.130
of collective governance.

00:25:53.130 --> 00:25:56.850
So what else is used, let's
say in historical assemblies?

00:25:56.850 --> 00:25:59.250
And this again, just to give
you a sense of what I mean

00:25:59.250 --> 00:26:02.760
by historical assemblies,
we coded a variety of them.

00:26:02.760 --> 00:26:05.250
Assemblies that operate
at the central level,

00:26:05.250 --> 00:26:07.620
which means the higher
administrative level

00:26:07.620 --> 00:26:09.840
within a community, and
assemblies that operate

00:26:09.840 --> 00:26:11.340
at the local level.

00:26:11.340 --> 00:26:13.915
So sort of like subunits
within a community.

00:26:13.915 --> 00:26:16.710
And we coded both at the local,

00:26:16.710 --> 00:26:19.980
at the central level, assemblies
that featured some sort

00:26:19.980 --> 00:26:22.770
of like, elite membership,

00:26:22.770 --> 00:26:24.720
or just a broader citizen assembly

00:26:24.720 --> 00:26:28.140
of the kinds that we are discussing today.

00:26:28.140 --> 00:26:31.110
Assemblies, again, this
reflects some of the stuff

00:26:31.110 --> 00:26:34.710
that I've already discussed,
are by and large a European

00:26:34.710 --> 00:26:38.310
and a little bit Asian
as well, phenomenon.

00:26:38.310 --> 00:26:42.010
And they are overwhelmingly
in the dataset central-

00:26:43.860 --> 00:26:47.223
and citizen-based, not elite.

00:26:49.050 --> 00:26:53.106
Okay, so just to give you a
sense of what else is going on,

00:26:53.106 --> 00:26:58.106
the lot appears so high up in this matrix,

00:27:00.720 --> 00:27:04.530
largely because it is used
so frequently in Athens

00:27:04.530 --> 00:27:06.090
and in other Greek polis.

00:27:06.090 --> 00:27:09.420
So this is actually a
somewhat of a false result

00:27:09.420 --> 00:27:12.990
because what's driving
the frequency here is

00:27:12.990 --> 00:27:14.910
really the sort of multiple uses

00:27:14.910 --> 00:27:19.170
that particularly Greek
polis made of lotteries.

00:27:19.170 --> 00:27:22.470
What else is going on in
terms of access mechanisms

00:27:22.470 --> 00:27:25.378
in global historical
collective governance,

00:27:25.378 --> 00:27:29.310
are the use of elections,
the use of age boundaries

00:27:29.310 --> 00:27:31.140
and the use of blood relations

00:27:31.140 --> 00:27:32.160
and property requirements.

00:27:32.160 --> 00:27:33.567
So if we look at global history,

00:27:33.567 --> 00:27:37.189
elections certainly
play a fundamental role.

00:27:37.189 --> 00:27:41.610
But the other systems of
selecting into into assemblies,

00:27:41.610 --> 00:27:45.090
again by and large central
nonelite assemblies,

00:27:45.090 --> 00:27:46.980
are systems that we actually associate

00:27:46.980 --> 00:27:51.090
with more oligarchical,
perhaps, structures today.

00:27:51.090 --> 00:27:54.333
Okay, alright, everyone's still with me?

00:27:55.200 --> 00:27:57.060
All right, you're still
nodding, which is amazing.

00:27:57.060 --> 00:27:58.470
I really appreciate it.

